  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The mound where Yu Mu Chun refines Gu holds the highest number of rule path dao marks nearby. Those silver-light marks are numerous but disorderly, some entangled and densely compacted, others scattered at random.",
      "chapters": [
        861
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_yu_mu_chun"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "General dao marks and attainment levels are covered on dao marks and attainment.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_dao_marks"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A life and death kun-peng corpse carries life and death dao marks, a special type of rule path dao mark that is very rare and valuable.",
      "chapters": [
        994
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "marks-on-dying-creatures",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spring dawn jade orioles hold many rule path life dao marks but live only a dozen or so breaths after hatching. Wherever they fly, their dao marks rain down, change the terrain, and pour out life force before they die.",
      "chapters": [
        1111
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "marks-on-dying-creatures",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "A sunken fish contains rule path and refinement path dao marks.",
      "chapters": [
        2238
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "marks-on-dying-creatures",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After it dies, those refinement path and rule path dao marks spread and influence the surroundings, and over thousands of years a coral refinement resource point forms there.",
      "chapters": [
        2239
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "marks-on-dying-creatures",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Among Fang Yuan’s dao marks, rule path dao marks number about twelve thousand, taken from Hei Fan grotto-heaven’s rule path Gu Immortal Chen Chi.",
      "chapters": [
        1161
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "personal-accumulation-and-use",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "loc_hei_fan_grotto_heaven",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_chen_chi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan could not use rule path Immortal Gu Fight properly while his rule path attainment was low and he had few rule path dao marks. After his rule path attainment rises steeply, the Gu coordinates with years flow like water Immortal Gu in Myriad Year Flying Warship.",
      "chapters": [
        1795
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "personal-accumulation-and-use",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "house_myriad_year_flying_warship"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In Crazed Demon Cave’s dense dao mark terrain, Not Immortal, a rule path Gu Immortal, tries to walk where there are more rule path dao marks to face less obstruction.",
      "chapters": [
        1188
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "navigating-by-mark-density",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_crazed_demon_cave",
        "char_not_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Not Immortal splits from the group deeper in Crazed Demon Cave, he walks toward the front-left where there are relatively more rule path dao marks, since he cultivates rule path.",
      "chapters": [
        1863
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "navigating-by-mark-density",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Novelty grotto-heaven contains over one million and six hundred thousand rule path dao marks, along with over one thousand nine hundred heaven path dao marks.",
      "chapters": [
        2077
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
